#. Description of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-migration.php
msgid "Moves forms, entries, files, settings and shortcodes from Suite Barrio, the previous plugin, with the WP-CLI command wp barrio forms migrate. Once done, it can be removed."
msgstr "Trasferisce form, registrazioni, file, impostazioni e shortcode da Suite Barrio, il plugin precedente, con il comando WP-CLI wp barrio forms migrate. Al termine puoi rimuoverlo."

